    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d134">

                <pb facs="0261" n="155" xml:id="pg155"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of the United States to the President of
                        Chile.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The White House</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <hi rendition="#italic"><date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1906-09-12">September 12,
                            1906</date></hi>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I thank you for your courteous telegram of the 5th instant. It is my earnest
                    desire that the visit of Secretary Root shall strengthen the close and cordial
                    relations uniting our two nations.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Theodore
                    Roosevelt.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
